{"id": 275, "forum": "5-dekorativnye-vodoemy", "title": "Декоративный водоём в КП Охтинский парк (Лен.Обл) 2019", "posts": [{"id": 1962, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2019-09-10", "html": "<p>Ведутся работы по строительству большого декоративного водоёма в кп Охтинский парк.<br>Подготовлен котлован и смонтирована гидроизоляция. Площадь гидроизоляции 1300 кв. м.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_34e22437db626e18ed7b824334d5f82d", "thumb": "", "name": "op001.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2758e6f5209c78a866a6dadc531f27a0", "thumb": "", "name": "op002.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_22f6e39708bbc337b7062510b8657904", "thumb": "", "name": "op003.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_8650f8f6135fedb8a5a48d90e11be92f", "thumb": "", "name": "op004.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2d607cb205bc534ba23b9a7b7ed75bf8", "thumb": "", "name": "op005.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ed6f3c03dbb63b03016acfa1d1c9f820", "thumb": "", "name": "op006.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_934904b818e4cd1d2d3140263aa4d9fe", "thumb": "", "name": "op007.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f0e86e43bc376c015bf02efa0c491644", "thumb": "", "name": "op008.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_c2b778187b0d71a07b17a8cdd5e02a4d", "thumb": "", "name": "op010.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b6b1be97e81a9dc0979c84625a73e972", "thumb": "", "name": "op0011.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 1980, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2019-10-21", "html": "<p>Произведена отсыпка гравием</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_bcf979a929e1dcac441c529e246776f6", "thumb": "", "name": "op012.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_79c9754774d78e04e11c41e9c341982c", "thumb": "", "name": "op013.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7c4a0ed114f8b5d3790f83316c18fb9d", "thumb": "", "name": "op014.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_4af8911f7a3e13928946088978548c07", "thumb": "", "name": "op015.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_454a46fe35f840743d30e4758d8cbe8e", "thumb": "", "name": "op016.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_4694c5df6cf535496459b58866c298c6", "